  lines:
  - I see it in your soul.
  - "You\u2019re serious about this, aren\u2019t you?"
  - "<?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1>Told you he wouldn\u2019t disappoint!"
  - <?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=1>All you did was hurt us.
  - "Well, it\u2019s not like\u2026"
  - <?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=1>Is this supposed to be some kind
    of apology?
  - "... they\u2019re getting a second chance."
